"impression_count":16,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"今日A股收盘总结（10月12日）\n\n1. 大盘走势\n今天三大指数集体收跌，上证微跌0.43%左右，深成指跌超2%，创业板指跌2.61%，科创50也跌超2%。全市场超4300只个股下跌，成交额缩量到约1.55万亿，比前一交易日少了三千多亿，赚钱效应一般。","url":"https://x.com/BaxYahya/status/2109546697177350341"},{"author_id":"1453893287606034438","created_at":"2026-10-12T07:08:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109541685118296334"],"id":"2109541685118296334","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":666,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"2026年10月12日A股收评：\n   1.指数概述： \n 创业板指缩量调整跌2.61%，全市场超4300只个股下跌，读 A股三大指数今日集体下跌，截至收盘，上证指数跌0.43%，深证成指跌2.03%，创业板指跌2.61%，北证50跌2.46%，科创50指数跌2.1%。全市场成交额15507亿元，较上日缩量3659亿元，全市场超4300只个股下跌。","url":"https://x.com/717171David/status/2109541685118296334"},{"article":{"title":"美股永远正确，A股一无是处？"},"author_id":"292708918","created_at":"2026-10-12T01:35:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109457812598452269"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/i/article/2109…","end":69,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2109450191199948800","start":46,"status":404,"unwound_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2109450191199948800","url":"https://t.co/NlGjt5G6Yy"}]},"id":"2109457812598452269","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":11071,"like_count":32,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":20,"retweet_count":5},"text":"国家强大、企业强大、股东富有，是三个不同的概念。真正成熟的资本市场，应该让三者形成良性循环 https://t.co/NlGjt5G6Yy","url":"https://x.com/laowangbj110/status/2109457812598452269"},{"author_id":"541462295","created_at":"2026-10-11T13:21:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109273118930042919"],"id":"2109273118930042919","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":974,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"周五市场午后探底回升，三大指数集体翻红，创业板指此前一度跌超3%，两市成交额1.9万亿，较上一个交易日放量2184亿，主力资金净流出174.7亿，两市涨跌中位数0.6%，截至收盘，沪指涨0.05%，深成指涨0.17%，创业板指涨0.22%，","url":"https://x.com/zhaoge168/status/2109273118930042919"},{"author_id":"172460174785397964